OL,3,AMen charged over alleged plot to target
OL,4,AManchester Jewish community
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Iranian nationals have been charged
OL,7,Fwith terror offences over an alleged
OL,8,Fplot to target the Jewish community in
OL,9,Fthe Manchester area ahead of Yom
OL,10,FKippur, Counter Terrorism Policing
OL,11,F(CTP) has said.
OL,13,FRahman Salehi, 35, and Salam Ahmadyan,
OL,14,F36, are accused of preparing to commit
OL,15,Fan act of terrorism or assisting
OL,16,Fanother to commit an act of terrorism
OL,17,Fon or before 20 September in
OL,18,FManchester.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
